SRR23148606	PRJNA925824	SRP418419	SAMN32810522	SRX19099411	Homo sapiens	Jurkat_TKOv3_LAI_gDNA Rep2	Jurkat_TKOv3_LAI_gDNA Rep2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM6945667: Jurkat_TKOv3_LAI_gDNA Rep2 Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Genomic DNA was extracted using a QIAamp DNA Blood Midi kit (Qiagen, Cat No 51183) Described in samples section on a per sample basis. Genomic DNA (gDNA) or reverse-transcribed viral RNA (vRNA) were amplified by a two-step PCR (PCR1: 12 cycles, PCR2: 20 cycles) to amplify 20bp sgRNA sequences in the HIV-CRISPR vector. All vRNA was amplified for each sample where appropriate. For gDNA samples, a total of 500-fold coverage of the sgRNAs were amplified (10^6 cells were estimated to contain 6.6μg gDNA) with a maximum of 2μg gDNA per PCR reaction. For each sample, PCR1 reactions were pooled, cleaned up over a QIAquick PCR purification Kit (2 columns per sample), pooled again and used as template for PCR2. For vRNA, all PCR1 was amplified in the second round. For gDNA, 10 uL of pooled PCR1 was used as input for PCR2 (PCR2 primers include Illumina barcodes and adaptor sequences). Amplicons from PCR2 were pooled, purified by double-sided bead cleanup (AMPureXP, Beckman Coulter), quantified with a Qubit dsDNA HS assay and pooled for sequencing.	37959109	2277546540	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR231/006/SRR23148606/SRR23148606.fastq.gz	76c956c51b2654ad3c4f8908c99dfd6b	1055948493
